{"product":{"id":9095436566684,"title":"VT COSMETICS PDRN Tension Toner Pads 170ml 60ea","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"youtube%20link%20here\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓Insert contents↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓--\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0506\/2121\/8972\/files\/VTCOSMETICSPDRNTensionTonerPads170ml60ea-1_600x600.jpg?v=1780295916\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eVT COSMETICS PDRN Tension Toner Pads 170ml 60ea\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eDescription\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTap into the benefits of ginseng for your skin! VT’s PDRN Tension Toner Pad is soaked in low-molecular ginseng-derived PDRN to boost skin’s radiance and elasticity levels. It’s also rich in moisturizing and barrier-strengthening ingredients like ceramides, panthenol and olive oil. Made with stretchable, vegan fabric, the toner pad offers cooling comfort, and it can also be used as a toner mask pack for more intensive skin care.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis toner pad with plant-based PDRN delivers the rich nutrients of ginseng and provides a healthy glow and moisture to the skin.\u003cbr\u003eInfused with Squalane and Olive Oil to help maintain skin moisture barrier.\u003cbr\u003eFormulated with Aginon to boost elasticity, making it ideal for tired, sagging skin.\u003cbr\u003eContains Hyaluronic Acid and Panthenol to hydrate and prevent moisture loss.\u003cbr\u003eUnscented and skin irritation tested, making it suitable for sensitive skin.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eHow to use\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAfter cleansing, apply the toner pad to the desired area. Remove the pad and gently pat for absorption.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIngredients\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWater, Dipropylene Glycol, Glycereth-26, Niacinamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Betaine, Hydroxyacetophenone, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Caprylic\/Capric Triglyceride, Glycerin, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Panthenol, Sodium Polyacrylate, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Squalane, Allantoin, Xanthan Gum, Adenosine, Disodium Edta, Ceramide NP, Cholesterol, Butylene Glycol, Phytosphingosine, Sodium Hyaluronate, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Althaea Rosea Root Extract, Thamnolia Vermicularis Leaf Extract, Hydroxypropyltrimonium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Panax Ginseng Root Extract, Hyaluronic Acid, Hydrolyzed Sodium Hyaluronate, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Sodium Dna, Potassium Hyaluronate\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSpecs\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBrand : VT COSMETICS\u003cbr\u003eCapacity : 170ml\u003cbr\u003eTarget Area : Face\u003cbr\u003eSkin Type : All Skin Types\u003cbr\u003eCountry of origin : South Korea\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!--kdrop--\u003e\u003c!--↑↑↑↑↑↑Please insert contents↑↑↑↑↑↑↑↑--\u003e","vendor":"VT COSMETICS","product_type":"Toner Pads","created_at":"2026-05-31T23:38:52-07:00","handle":"vt-cosmetics-pdrn-tension-toner-pads-170ml-60ea","updated_at":"2026-10-30T21:28:46-07:00","published_at":"2026-06-01T01:20:47-07:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"global","tags":"hyaluronic acid, new, Niacinamide","variants":[{"id":46993139925148,"product_id":9095436566684,"title":"Default Title","price":"22.75","sku":"8803463014407","position":1,"compare_at_price":"31.50","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-05-31T23:38:52-07:00","updated_at":"202